            <span>📊</span> Connect Form to Google Sheets in 1 Minute
          </h3>
          <button type="button" id="btnCloseDocsModal" style="background: transparent; border: none; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px;">
          FastPress uses Google Apps Script to securely write form entries to your Google Sheet without complex API keys or OAuth logins. Follow these 3 simple steps:
        </p>

        <ol style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>Open or create the destination spreadsheet at <a href="https://sheets.new" target="_blank" style="color: #60a5fa;">sheets.new</a>. Submissions will be saved into <strong>that exact spreadsheet</strong> (a Web App URL does not create a new file on its own).</li>
          <li>Inside that Google Sheet, click <strong>Extensions &rarr; Apps Script</strong> (do not create a standalone project at script.google.com).</li>
          <li>Replace the code with the script below, click <strong>Deploy &rarr; New deployment &rarr; Web App</strong>, set <strong>Execute as: Me</strong> and <strong>Who has access: Anyone</strong> (required to avoid HTTP 403), click <strong>Deploy</strong>, and paste the <strong>Web App URL</strong> into <strong>Form &amp; Sheets</strong>.</li>
        </ol>

        <div style="position: relative; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <pre style="background: #090c12; border: 1px solid #28334a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #e5e7eb; overflow-x: auto; font-family: monospace; max-height: 220px;" id="scriptSnippetCode">{`function doPost(e) {
  try {
    var contents = JSON.parse(e.postData.contents);
    var ss = contents.sheetUrl
      ? SpreadsheetApp.openByUrl(contents.sheetUrl)
      : SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet();

    if (!ss) {
      throw new Error("No spreadsheet found. Open your Google Sheet and click Extensions > Apps Script.");
    }

    var tabName = (contents.tabName || "").trim();
    var sheet = tabName
      ? (ss.getSheetByName(tabName) || ss.insertSheet(tabName))
      : ss.getActiveSheet();

    var data = contents.data || {};
    var keys = Object.keys(data);

    // Auto-create headers if sheet is empty
    if (sheet.getLastRow() === 0) {
      sheet.appendRow(["Timestamp", "Form Name"].concat(keys));
    }

    var headers = sheet.getRange(1, 1, 1, sheet.getLastColumn()).getValues()[0];
    keys.forEach(function(k) {
      if (headers.indexOf(k) === -1) {
        headers.push(k);
        sheet.getRange(1, headers.length).setValue(k);
      }
    });

    var row = headers.map(function(h) {
      if (h === "Timestamp") return contents.submittedAt || new Date().toISOString();
      if (h === "Form Name") return contents.formName || "";
      return data[h] !== undefined ? data[h] : "";
    });

    sheet.appendRow(row);

    return ContentService.createTextOutput(JSON.stringify({
      result: "success",
      spreadsheetUrl: ss.getUrl(),
      spreadsheetName: ss.getName(),
      sheetName: sheet.getName()
    })).setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.JSON);
  } catch(err) {
    return ContentService.createTextOutput(JSON.stringify({
      result: "error",
      error: err.toString()
    })).setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.JSON);
  }
}`}</pre>
